# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Blin Finance — Testnet Deployment Environment
# Copy this file to .env.testnet and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit .env.testnet — it contains your private key!
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Your deployer wallet private key (the wallet paying gas + receiving test tokens)
# Get testnet ETH from:
#   Arbitrum Sepolia → https://faucet.arbitrum.io
#   BSC Testnet      → https://testnet.binance.org/faucet-smart
DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY=0x_YOUR_PRIVATE_KEY_HERE

# RPC endpoint — optional, hardhat.config.ts has public defaults:
#   Arbitrum Sepolia default: https://sepolia-rollup.arbitrum.io/rpc
#   BSC Testnet default:      https://data-seed-prebsc-1-s1.binance.org:8545/
# Uncomment and set if you want a private RPC (Alchemy, Infura, etc.):
# RPC_URL=https://arb-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
